&lt;li&gt;Reduce allocations in &lt;code&gt;HttpRequestUtils.GetUrl()&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3938438009" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/8203" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8203/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8203"&gt;#8203&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
