&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Continuous Profiler&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Profiler] cleanup thread names and IDs (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3907393289" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/8169" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8169/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8169"&gt;#8169&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Profiler] Fix bug in managed code cache (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3915094034" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/8177" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8177/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8177"&gt;#8177&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Debugger&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Dynamic Instrumentation] DEBUG-4689 Remove the 100-probe limit for Dynamic Instrumentation (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3643617498" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7848" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7848/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7848"&gt;#7848&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
